@base = http://localhost:7071
@token = local-user
@resumeId = RESUME_ID
@runId = run-1

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Unauthenticated library → 401
GET {{base}}/api/resumes

### List resumes
GET {{base}}/api/resumes?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload PDF or DOCX (multipart field name: file)
POST {{base}}/api/resumes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ResumeBoundary

------ResumeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cv.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./cv.docx
------ResumeBoundary--

### Resume detail (status: uploaded | parsing | parsed | parse_failed)
GET {{base}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Short-lived original-file preview URL
GET {{base}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/preview-url
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Patch structured fields (name + email or phone + experience or education)
PATCH {{base}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": {
    "fullName": "Jane Doe",
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "phone": "+15555550100"
  },
  "skills": ["Python", "Azure"],
  "experience": [
    {
      "title": "Engineer",
      "company": "Example",
      "startDate": "2020-01",
      "endDate": "2024-06",
      "description": "Built APIs"
    }
  ]
}

### Retry a failed parse
POST {{base}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/retry-parse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Set the active resume for an apply run
POST {{base}}/api/runs/{{runId}}/active-resume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resumeId": "{{resumeId}}"
}

### Get the active resume for a run
GET {{base}}/api/runs/{{runId}}/active-resume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft-delete a resume
DELETE {{base}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
